{"name": "Anchor's Lament", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ANCHOR'S LAMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is a multiplayer roguelike strategy game, where you as your own captain travel the thousands seas to find glory! On your way you gather a crew of exotic animals and creatures that will help you fight other captain's that stand in your way. In this world, all life is sentient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"38\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/792056dcb7ab51063450eb5378565a59.webp?t=1776946943\" width=\"614\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/3234dc90b5f1c316cfac997cc32f8711.poster.avif?t=1776946943\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/3234dc90b5f1c316cfac997cc32f8711.webm?t=1776946943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/3234dc90b5f1c316cfac997cc32f8711.mp4?t=1776946943\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Nautical Units and place them in a 2x4 grid!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Position units with multiple unique abilities to synergies and trigger each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip them with items!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enchant Grid slots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight against real players asynchronically! No wait queues only domination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"38\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/dc502c53cfafabb27225e80abed09344.webp?t=1776946943\" width=\"614\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/30f8363c482362f342cb313b1b6c2f29.webp?t=1776946943\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/30f8363c482362f342cb313b1b6c2f29.poster.avif?t=1776946943\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"38\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/a9640a65199d7b341ee1aa657725fc69.webp?t=1776946943\" width=\"614\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our goal is that every other month we release a new season with new units, new events and new mechanics. Each new season will drastically change the gameplay. But as the old season rotates out, don't worry, you can still play it in our CHAOS MODE, where any player may choose any season to play against other players with the same rules. Everyone can keep playing their favorite builds for ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/4b22bfc56e6c04b2e0929d22dfa8067f.webp?t=1776946943\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/extras/4b22bfc56e6c04b2e0929d22dfa8067f.poster.avif?t=1776946943\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BRING YOUR GAME EVERYWHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the game on your computer or phone! Data will carry over as well as any collected items!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FREE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is free! you can buy cosmetics that we have made to help us fund the game for the future!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Anchor's Lament is a multiplayer roguelite strategy game where you build your team to fight other players with a unique gameplay mechanic! Everything follow the beat of the anchor!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831400/d627d8d3dab94914ae56083de543c28342a60db9/header.jpg?t=1776946943", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Strategy", "PvP", "Roguelike", "Character Customization", "2D"], "developers": "Imperial Playgrounds", "publishers": "Imperial Playgrounds", "release_date": "Apr 23, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "3831400", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 April 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/AHA-q_t8jhc", "first_seen": 1776895200.0, "review_rank": 796}